        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PBB RS813535, UL Listed Spring 3.5\" x 3.5\" Single Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Single Action Spring Door Hinge and screws.  This PBB spring hinges are UL Listed for fire door applications. Max door size: 2’6 ft x 7’0.ft x 1-3/4 inches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the PBB Full Mortise Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Height of Barrel: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed for Fire Doors</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .100</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - ANSI K81071F</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size – 2’6” x 7’0” based on 3 hinges per door.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PBB-RS813535-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262436\" target=\"new\"><b>PBB RS813535 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually (1 Hinge).</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "3.5 x 3.5 UL Listed Spring Hinge",
                "description": "Packaged complete with a Single Action Spring Door Hinge and screws.  This PBB spring hinges are UL Listed for fire door applications. Max door size: 3ft. x 7ft. x 1-3/4 inches. Max door weight: 110 lbs. For doors up to 85 lbs, use 2 spring hinges at center and bottom position with 1 ball bearing hinge at top position. For 85 to 110 lb doors, use 3 spring hinges:",
